Vulkan: skip draws and dispatches whose pipeline failed to compile.

Blender-owned files; each hunk is enclosed in "UPBGE - Android" comments.
Not Android specific: any driver can fail to compile a heavy shader.

VKPipelinePool ignores the VkResult of vkCreate*Pipelines, so a failed
compilation leaves VK_NULL_HANDLE in the node's pipeline data and the render
graph binds it. On Mali r49p1 the EEVEE deferred light pipelines fail with
VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED and vkCmdBindPipeline(VK_NULL_HANDLE) crashes
libGLES_mali.so in the submission thread.

The six draw/dispatch nodes now return before touching any state when the
pipeline is null. The bound state tracking (VKBoundPipelines) is not updated,
so it stays in sync with the command buffer and the next valid node rebinds
whatever it needs. Cost: one compare per node while building commands.

The affected pass is missing from the frame instead of crashing the player.
Failed pipelines are only reported by the temporary 0007 patch.

Independent of 0001-0009.

diff --git a/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/render_graph/nodes/vk_dispatch_indirect_node.hh b/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/render_graph/nodes/vk_dispatch_indirect_node.hh
index b2a90e5..08d024a 100644
--- a/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/render_graph/nodes/vk_dispatch_indirect_node.hh
+++ b/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/render_graph/nodes/vk_dispatch_indirect_node.hh
@@ -76,6 +76,13 @@ class VKDispatchIndirectNode
                       Span<uint8_t> storage_push_constants,
                       VKBoundPipelines &r_bound_pipelines) override
   {
+    /* UPBGE - Android: VKPipelinePool ignores the vkCreateComputePipelines result, so a
+     * pipeline the driver failed to compile is VK_NULL_HANDLE. Binding it crashes some
+     * drivers. Drop the dispatch; bound state is left untouched. */
+    if (data.pipeline_data.vk_pipeline == VK_NULL_HANDLE) {
+      return;
+    }
+    /* UPBGE - Android */
     vk_pipeline_data_build_commands(command_buffer,
                                     data.pipeline_data,
                                     storage_push_constants,
